sequenceDiagram
    participant TS as Task Scheduler
    participant Apps as startup_apps.ps1
    participant PX as startup_px.ps1
    participant Ollama as startup_ollama.ps1
    participant VM as startup_vm.ps1
    participant Web as Open WebUI

    TS->>Apps: boot/logon + 30s
    Apps->>PX: iniciar/validar porta 18080
    PX-->>Apps: OK
    Apps->>Ollama: iniciar/validar portas 11434/11435/11436
    Ollama-->>Apps: OK
    Apps->>VM: iniciar Multipass ia-lab
    VM->>VM: detectar IP
    VM->>VM: recriar portproxy 127.0.0.1:3000
    VM->>Web: validar porta 3000
    Web-->>Apps: OK
